OL,3,GNEWSAChildminder who left more than 20
OL,4,Achildren alone in her home jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA childminder who admitted leaving
OL,7,Fchildren she was caring for alone and
OL,8,Funsupervised in her home has been
OL,9,Fjailed for two years.
OL,11,FMore than 20 unattended children, two
OL,12,Funder the age of one, were in Amanda
OL,13,FMathewson's house in Dunfermline, Fife,
OL,14,Fwhen she was arrested in August 2024.
OL,16,FHer offending only came to light after
OL,17,Fconcerned parents spied on her leaving
OL,18,Ffor a school run without their
OL,19,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
